msgid ""
"Defense Minister Tamiya used to be a police officer, you know. They say he's"
" got ties to Interpol, and his position gets him all the insider info on "
"foreign affairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "That right?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

